# The build context for every sandbox image is THIS directory (images/), and
# the Dockerfiles COPY exactly one file out of it: the ACP driver. This is an
# allowlist — everything is ignored unless named below — so a stray file
# dropped beside the Dockerfiles can never ride into an image's build context,
# and context uploads stay small and byte-stable.
*
!acp-driver
!acp-driver/ship-acp.mjs
